    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: C3 (CE-2152) - the casualty-care squad (Leader, Medic, Rifleman 1-4 at (262-345,200-290)) is under heavy fire from three immortal Hostile 1-3 at (375-385,175-225) with sight of Rifleman 3, who the check drops to 25 HP. Shows the rescue score staying low while the fight is hot. Judge: (1) for 30 s after he falls the squad does NOT start CasualtyCare and nobody gets a CarryCasualty order; (2) nobody carries him; (3) when the check sets the three hostiles to 0 HP the squad goes for him at once (CasualtyCare within 20 s); (4) then the drag, put-down alive and return to the fight as in ua-casualty-care. Fail: The Medic runs out under fire, or the squad ignores him after the enemy is down. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch ua-casualty-care-heavy"
